<Sequence DisplayName="Conflict Resolution Bot - Main" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_43">
<sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>CONFLICT RESOLUTION BOT — implements docs/phase2/bot_conflict.md.

Safety rails (non-negotiable, mirrored in rules.yaml safety and enforced again
by the HMS): no move inside 4h, no automatic move of URGENT, max 2 automatic
moves per appointment, never move a patient later during backfill, never delete
records, always notify, always audit, block slots before a cascade.</sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>
