<Sequence DisplayName="Strategy B - DOCTOR_UNAVAILABLE" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_14">
<sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>Block the slots BEFORE rescheduling anyone. A half day of leave is 12 to 16
patients and takes minutes to work through; without blocking first the
Scheduling Bot can book a new patient into the very gap this bot is emptying.

Work in priority order so the urgent patient gets the good replacement slot.</sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>
