<Sequence DisplayName="Strategy C - CANCELLATION_CASCADE" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_18">
<sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>A cancellation is an opportunity the manual process wastes.

Backfill only ever moves a patient EARLIER. Moving someone later to fill a gap
optimises the calendar at the patient's expense. Switched off entirely by
conflicts.backfill.enable_waitlist_backfill = false.</sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>
