<Sequence DisplayName="Strategy D - EXCEL_MISMATCH" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_21">
<sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>The HMS is the system of record. Excel is corrected; the HMS is never edited
from Excel. An orphan row in Excel may be the only trace of a booking the HMS
lost, so it is escalated and never auto-deleted.</sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>
