</Sequence>
<Sequence DisplayName="Close out" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_25">
<sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>Escalation is a correct outcome, not a failure — the transaction is still set
Successful. SuggestedSlot is included even when the bot declined to act, so the
clerk gets a one-click decision instead of a research task.

Every reschedule notifies the patient BEFORE the transaction closes, and writes
an audit row. A silent move is worse than no move.</sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText>
